{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-information-causality-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:information-causality-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 1 from rem:information-causality","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-information-causality"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"information-causality-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:information-causality-table-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Information principle</th>\n<th>QOU expression</th>\n<th>Value at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Light cone <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">=</code> Lieb--Robinson cone</td>\n<td>causal boundary at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lvert Z \\rvert = c_q</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Speed of light</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_q = 1/(q-1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_q \\approx 9.093</code> (Reeb units)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Margolus--Levitin rate</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_R(q) \\leq \\dfrac{2m}{\\pi\\hbar_q(q-1)^2}</code></td>\n<td>saturated up to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2/\\pi</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bremermann bandwidth</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{B}(q) = \\dfrac{q\\eta_q}{(q-1)^2}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\approx 82</code> q-bits / Planck time</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bekenstein fibre entropy</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_{\\mathrm{fibre}} \\leq \\eta_q = \\dfrac{2q - 1}{q^3}</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/information-causality-table-data.md","heading":"Table"}
